# Skills (load on demand)

Installed skills live in `~/.cursor/skills/`. **Never** dump the full pack into context.

1. For task→skill mapping, read [`docs/AGENT_SKILLS.md`](docs/AGENT_SKILLS.md).
2. When a row matches, `Read` that skill’s `SKILL.md` before acting.
3. Prefer one skill; respect [`docs/CDS_PHI_BOUNDARY.md`](docs/CDS_PHI_BOUNDARY.md) — no live CDS/PHI, no Gate C auto-approve, no invented MoU.
4. Adjacent browse tools (PentAGI, RAG-Anything, Anime.js, MediSearch, Hippocratic, Nabla) stay **out of product code**.
5. Cursor built-ins (`create-rule`, `create-skill`, `review-security`, …) are under `~/.cursor/skills-cursor/`.
